@startuml ssd-dashboard-embed
' Reasoning: dashboard embed is black-box from the admin/consumer view. The
' external dashboard service is represented only as an effect of BEACON's response.
title BEACON - SSD - Dashboard Embed

autonumber

actor Admin as admin
participant "BEACON Platform" as beacon

admin -> beacon : Request dashboard embed for site/dashboard
beacon --> admin : Return dashboard identifier and embed URL

@enduml
